(The Philosophy of History) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(     Georg Wilhelm Friedrich Hegel was born on August 27, 1770, at) Tj T*
(     Stuttgart, the capital of Würtemburg, in which state his father) Tj T*
(     occupied a humble position in government service. He was educated) Tj T*
(     at Tübingen for the ministry, and while there was, in private, a) Tj T*
(     diligent student of Kant and Rousseau. In 1805 he was Professor) Tj T*
