(_III.--Of Inequality_) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Plutarch somewhere says that he finds no such great difference between) Tj T*
(beast and beast as between man and man. He speaks of the mind and) Tj T*
(internal qualities. I could find in my heart to say there is more) Tj T*
