(then, if my life would not have been shorter, had I taken part in public) Tj T*
(life.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(But I have never posed as an instructor or taken money for giving) Tj T*
(instruction. Anyone who chooses can question me and hear what I have to) Tj T*
(say. People take pleasure in my society, because they like to hear those) Tj T*
