(for us. To prepare us for complete living is the function which) Tj T*
(education is to discharge. We must therefore classify the leading kinds) Tj T*
(of activity which constitute human life. In order of importance they are) Tj T*
(\(1\) those which directly minister to self-preservation, \(2\) those which) Tj T*
(by securing the necessaries of life indirectly minister to) Tj T*
(self-preservation, \(3\) those which have for their end the rearing and) Tj T*
(discipline of offspring, \(4\) those which are involved in the maintenance) Tj T*
(of proper social and political relations, \(5\) those miscellaneous) Tj T*
(activities which fill up the leisure part of life, devoted to the) Tj T*
(gratification of the tastes and feelings.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
