() Tj T*
(An offence--a punishable act--is constituted such by the community;) Tj T*
(though it ought not to be an offense unless contrary to utility, it may) Tj T*
(be so. It is assumed to be a detrimental act; detrimental therefore to) Tj T*
(some person or persons, whether the offender himself or other assignable) Tj T*
(persons, or to persons not assignable.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
