(first class; offences against individuals, or private offences, or) Tj T*
(private extra-regarding offences. The second class is formed by) Tj T*
(semi-public offences, _i.e._, not against assignable individuals, nor) Tj T*
(the community at large, but a separable group in the community, _e.g._,) Tj T*
(a class or a locality. The third class are those which are simply) Tj T*
(self-regarding; the fourth, against the community at large; the fifth,) Tj T*
(multiform or heterogeneous, comprising falsehood and breaches of trust.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
