(and the invention of contrivances to aid markmanship, cause such) Tj T*
(effectiveness of fire that it would be quite possible for rival armies) Tj T*
(totally to annihilate each other. But a similar improvement has taken) Tj T*
(place in artillery. The introduction of the quick-firing gun has) Tj T*
(multiplied the speed of artillery fire many times over. The range has) Tj T*
(been increased by the perfecting of the structure of the guns, the use) Tj T*
(of nickel steel in the manufacture of projectiles, and the employment of) Tj T*
(smokeless powder of immense explosive force.) Tj T*
