(favourable to intelligence. To strengthen this reciprocal action of the) Tj T*
(intellect and the social affections is the first task of universal) Tj T*
(morals. And the double opposition between man's moral and material need) Tj T*
(of intellectual toil and his dislike of it, and again between man's) Tj T*
