(Necessary as the military stage was, it was merely provisional, it must) Tj T*
(be succeeded by the industrial stage. Meantime, we are in the) Tj T*
(transitional stage between the two, for we have defensive instead of) Tj T*
(offensive military organisation, which is becoming more and more) Tj T*
(subordinate to industrial production.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The military stage corresponded with the theological stage, belonged to) Tj T*
(the same _régime_, had common antipathies and sympathies as well as) Tj T*
(general interests, and could not have worked without the aid of) Tj T*
(theological convictions to give blind confidence in military superiors.) Tj T*
(The industrial stage corresponds with the positive stage; it is akin in) Tj T*
(spirit, in origin, and in destination. The transitional stage, again,) Tj T*
(corresponds with the metaphysical stage. Only on these three dualisms) Tj T*
(which I have established can a sound historical philosophy be based.) Tj T*
