(     Henry George was born at Philadelphia on September 2, 1839. After) Tj T*
(     spending some years at sea, he reached California in 1858, became a) Tj T*
(     printer, and later a journalist and director of the public library) Tj T*
(     in San Francisco. In 1871 he published "Our Land Policy," and this) Tj T*
