(arts advance, deepens the poverty of the lowest class, we must find the) Tj T*
(law which determines what part of the produce is distributed to labour) Tj T*
(as wages, what part to capital as interest, and what part to landowners) Tj T*
(as rent.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Rent is the price of monopoly arising from the reduction to individual) Tj T*
(ownership of natural elements which human exertion can neither produce) Tj T*
(nor increase. Interest is not properly a payment made for the use of) Tj T*
(capital. It springs from the power of increase which the reproductive) Tj T*
(forces of nature and the \(in effect\) analogous capacity for exchange) Tj T*
(give to capital. The principle that men will seek to gratify their) Tj T*
(desires with the least exertion operates to establish an equilibrium) Tj T*
(between wages and interest.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This relation fixed, it is evident that interest cannot be increased) Tj T*
