() Tj T*
(The effects of the remedy would be to lift the whole enormous weight of) Tj T*
(taxation from productive industry. It would open new opportunities, for) Tj T*
(no one would care to hold land unless to use it, and land now withheld) Tj T*
(from use would everywhere be thrown open to improvement. The selling) Tj T*
(price of not merely agricultural, but all land, would fall. The bonus) Tj T*
(that wherever labour is most productive must not be paid before labour) Tj T*
(can be exerted would disappear. Competition in the labour market would) Tj T*
(no longer be one-sided. Rent, instead of causing inequality, would) Tj T*
(promote equality. Labour and capital would receive the whole produce,) Tj T*
(minus that portion taken by the state in the taxation of land values,) Tj T*
(which, being applied to public purposes, would be equally distributed in) Tj T*
(public benefits. The equalisation in the distribution of wealth would) Tj T*
(react upon production, everywhere preventing waste, everywhere) Tj T*
(increasing power.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Simplicity in the legislative and executive functions of government) Tj T*
(would become possible. It would at the same time and in the same degree) Tj T*
(become possible for it to realise the dream of socialism, not through) Tj T*
(governmental repression, but because government would become the) Tj T*
(administration of a great co-operative society, merely the agency by) Tj T*
(which the common property was administered for the common benefit. Give) Tj T*
(labour a free field and its full earnings, take for the benefit of the) Tj T*
(whole community that fund which the growth of the community creates, and) Tj T*
(want, and the fear of want, would be gone.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(If the conclusions at which we have arrived are correct, they will fall) Tj T*
