(man, no matter how low in the scale of humanity, has never yet been) Tj T*
(found destitute of the power of improvement. Everywhere and at all times) Tj T*
(he has made some use of this power. The varying degrees in which the) Tj T*
(faculty is used cannot be ascribed to differences in original capacity.) Tj T*
(These are evidently connected with social development. A survey of) Tj T*
(history shows diversities in improvement, halts, and retrogression; and) Tj T*
(the law which will explain all these is that men tend to progress just) Tj T*
(as they come closer together, and by co-operation with each other,) Tj T*
(increase the mental power that may be devoted to improvement.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(But just as conflict is provoked, or association develops inequality of) Tj T*
(condition and power, this tendency to progression is lessened, checked,) Tj T*
(and finally reversed. As society develops there arise tendencies which) Tj T*
(check development. The process of integration, of the specialisation of) Tj T*
(functions and powers, is accompanied by a constant liability to) Tj T*
(inequality, and to lodge collective power and wealth in the hands of a) Tj T*
(few, which tends to produce greater inequality, since aggression grows) Tj T*
(on what it feeds.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The reform I have proposed accords with all that is politically,) Tj T*
(socially, or morally desirable. It has the qualities of a true reform,) Tj T*
