(however, everything depends upon the political virtues of the people.) Tj T*
(When a democracy loses its patriotism, its frugality, and its passion) Tj T*
(for equality, it is soon destroyed by avarice and ambition.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The principle of democracy grows corrupt, not only when a people loses) Tj T*
