(     the heart very imperfectly regulated by a brilliant but eccentric) Tj T*
(     brain. As a political essay it is a tissue of fantastic arguments,) Tj T*
(     based on unreal hypotheses. But it set men's minds on fire; it was) Tj T*
(     the literary inspiration of one of the most tremendous events in) Tj T*
(     history, and those who would comprehend the French Revolution can) Tj T*
(     unravel many of its perplexities by studying the "Social Contract.") Tj T*
